TI  - Geographical Graph Attention Networks: Spatial Deep Learning Models for Spatial Prediction and Exploratory Spatial Data Analysis
T2  - TRANSACTIONS IN GIS
LA  - English
KW  - deep learning
KW  - ESDA
KW  - GeoAI
KW  - spatial prediction
