TI  - Data Acquisition and Processing for GeoAI Models to Support Sustainable Agricultural Practices
T2  - PROCEEDINGS OF THE 53RD ANNUAL HAWAII INTERNATIONAL CONFERENCE ON SYSTEM SCIENCES
LA  - English
CP  - 53rd Annual Hawaii International Conference on System Sciences (HICSS)
