TI  - Modeling education impact: a machine learning-based approach for improving the quality of school education
T2  - JOURNAL OF COMPUTERS IN EDUCATION
LA  - English
KW  - School education
KW  - Passing percentage
KW  - Success rate
KW  - Data sets
KW  - Artificial intelligence
