TI  - A novel GeoAI-based multidisciplinary model for SpatioTemporal Decision-Making of utility-scale wind-solar installations: To promote green infrastructure in Iraq
T2  - EGYPTIAN JOURNAL OF REMOTE SENSING AND SPACE SCIENCES
LA  - English
