TI  - GeoAI: a review of artificial intelligence approaches for the interpretation of complex geomatics data
T2  - GEOSCIENTIFIC INSTRUMENTATION METHODS AND DATA SYSTEMS
LA  - English
KW  - SEMANTIC SEGMENTATION
KW  - OBJECT DETECTION
KW  - POINT CLOUDS
KW  - DEEP
