TI  - Health GeoAI beyond algorithms: Embedding equity, accountability, and environmental responsibility
T2  - GEOGRAPHY AND SUSTAINABILITY
LA  - English
KW  - Health GeoAI
KW  - Responsible AI
KW  - Geographical equity
