TI  - A Geo-AI Approach for Electric Vehicle Charging Infrastructure Allocation: Case Studies from Marrakech-Safi Region, Morocco, and Andalucia Region, Spain
T2  - DIGITAL TECHNOLOGIES AND APPLICATIONS, ICDTA 2024, VOL 4
LA  - English
CP  - 4th International Conference on Digital Technologies and Applications (ICDTA)
KW  - Clustering
