TI  - GeoAnalystBench: A GeoAI Benchmark for Assessing Large Language Models for Spatial Analysis Workflow and Code Generation
T2  - TRANSACTIONS IN GIS
LA  - English
KW  - benchmark
KW  - GeoAI
KW  - language agent
KW  - LLM
