TI  - A LLM-based agent for the construction of typhoon knowledge graphs
T2  - ENVIRONMENTAL MODELLING & SOFTWARE
LA  - English
KW  - Typhoon knowledge graph
KW  - Large language models
KW  - Chain-of-thought reasoning
KW  - Geospatial artificial intelligence
