TI  - Harnessing compound flood risk assessment Utilizing a physics-informed GeoAI surrogate framework considering social vulnerability sources
T2  - JOURNAL OF ENVIRONMENTAL MANAGEMENT
LA  - English
KW  - Compound flood
KW  - Hydrodynamic model
KW  - Physics-informed GeoAI
KW  - Social vulnerability
