TI  - High-Resolution GeoAI framework for automated rutting depth prediction on logging trails using TransRAUnet and LiDAR
T2  - COMPUTERS AND ELECTRONICS IN AGRICULTURE
LA  - English
KW  - Rutting depth prediction
KW  - Logging trails
KW  - TransRAUnet
