TI  - Map2ImLas: Large-scale 2D-3D airborne dataset with map-based annotations
T2  - ISPRS OPEN JOURNAL OF PHOTOGRAMMETRY AND REMOTE SENSING
LA  - English
KW  - Airborne data
KW  - Topographic maps
KW  - Semantic segmentation
KW  - Object delineation
