TI  - LLM-enhanced disaster geolocalization using implicit geoinformation from multimodal data: A case study of Hurricane Harvey
T2  - INTERNATIONAL JOURNAL OF APPLIED EARTH OBSERVATION AND GEOINFORMATION
LA  - English
KW  - Geolocalization
KW  - Disaster response
KW  - Social media
KW  - GeoAI
KW  - LLM
