TI  - SRL: Towards a General-Purpose Framework for Spatial Representation Learning
T2  - 32ND ACM SIGSPATIAL INTERNATIONAL CONFERENCE ON ADVANCES IN GEOGRAPHIC INFORMATION SYSTEMS, ACM SIGSPATIAL 2024
