TI  - At what thresholds do blue-green spaces promote walking for older adults? A GeoAI inquiry into nonlinear thresholds and spatial heterogeneity
T2  - JOURNAL OF ENVIRONMENTAL MANAGEMENT
LA  - English
KW  - Blue-green space
KW  - older adults
KW  - Walking behavior
KW  - Spatial heterogeneity
KW  - Nonlinearity
