TI  - Cross-view geolocalization and disaster mapping with street-view and VHR satellite imagery: A case study of Hurricane IAN
T2  - ISPRS JOURNAL OF PHOTOGRAMMETRY AND REMOTE SENSING
LA  - English
KW  - Cross-view
KW  - Disaster response
KW  - GeoAI
KW  - Human-urban interaction
