TI  - Enhancing the Performance of Machine Learning and Deep Learning-Based Flood Susceptibility Models by Integrating Grey Wolf Optimizer (GWO) Algorithm
T2  - REMOTE SENSING
LA  - English
KW  - flood susceptibility modeling
KW  - geospatial artificial intelligence
KW  - grey wolf optimizer (GWO)
