TI  - Democratizing planetary-scale analysis: an ultra-lightweight Earth embedding database for accurate and flexible global land monitoring
T2  - EARTH SYSTEM SCIENCE DATA
LA  - English
KW  - SURFACE REFLECTANCE
KW  - MODIS
KW  - COVER
KW  - FUSION
