TI  - Spatial Task-Explicity Matters in Prompting Large Multimodal Models for Spatial Planning
T2  - PROCEEDINGS OF THE 7TH ACM SIGSPATIAL INTERNATIONAL WORKSHOP ON AI FOR GEOGRAPHIC KNOWLEDGE DISCOVERY, GEOAI 2024
LA  - English
CP  - 7th International Workshop on AI for Geographic Knowledge Discovery
