TI  - BuildingView: Constructing Urban Building Exteriors Databases with Street View Imagery and Multimodal Large Language Model
T2  - SPATIAL DATA AND INTELLIGENCE, SPATIALDI 2025
LA  - English
CP  - 6th China Conference on Spatial Data and Intelligence-SPATIALDI
