TI  - Leveraging explainable artificial intelligence and big trip data to understand factors influencing willingness to ridesharing
T2  - TRAVEL BEHAVIOUR AND SOCIETY
LA  - English
KW  - Ridesharing
KW  - Ride-hailing
KW  - Machine learning
KW  - GeoAI
