TI  - Keeping pace with a changing planet: An interactive segmentation framework for refining delineations of dynamic Earth features with the Segment Anything Model
T2  - INTERNATIONAL JOURNAL OF APPLIED EARTH OBSERVATION AND GEOINFORMATION
LA  - English
KW  - Segment Anything Model (SAM)
KW  - Geospatial AI
KW  - Zero-shot segmentation
