TI  - An Open-Source Deep Learning Framework for Scalable Urban Heat Island Detection Using Geospatial Data
T2  - ISPRS ICWG IV/III/II FOSS4G, FREE AND OPEN SOURCE SOFTWARE FOR GEOSPATIAL, EUROPE 2025-ACADEMIC TRACK, VOLUME XLVIII-4/W13-2025
