TI  - GeoIndia V2: A Unified Graph and Language Model for Context-Aware Geocoding
T2  - PROCEEDINGS OF THE 34TH ACM INTERNATIONAL CONFERENCE ON INFORMATION AND KNOWLEDGE MANAGEMENT, CIKM 2025
LA  - English
