TI  - Spatiotemporal assessment of forest dynamics to decipher landscape ecological insights on forest fragmentation in Kangra region (2019-2025) using FRAGSTATS and geospatial AI techniques
T2  - ENVIRONMENTAL AND SUSTAINABILITY INDICATORS
