TI  - Automated terrain feature identification from remote sensing imagery: a deep learning approach
T2  - INTERNATIONAL JOURNAL OF GEOGRAPHICAL INFORMATION SCIENCE
LA  - English
KW  - Deep convolutional neural network (DCNN)
KW  - object detection
KW  - terrain analysis
KW  - ensemble learning
