TI  - TorchSpatial: A Python Package for Spatial Representation Learning and Geo-Aware Model Development
T2  - PROCEEDINGS OF 3RD ACM SIGSPATIAL INTERNATIONAL WORKSHOP ON SPATIAL BIG DATA AND AI FOR INDUSTRIAL APPLICATIONS, GEOINDUSTRY 2024
LA  - English
