TI  - Crossing Boundaries: The Ethics of AI and Geographic Information Technologies
T2  - ISPRS INTERNATIONAL JOURNAL OF GEO-INFORMATION
LA  - English
KW  - slums
KW  - ethics of AI
KW  - ethics of geographic information
