TI  - Semantic urban elements: A Design plus Science paradigm to augment human-centric cities?
T2  - ENVIRONMENT AND PLANNING B-URBAN ANALYTICS AND CITY SCIENCE
LA  - English
KW  - urban analytics
KW  - urban design
KW  - computational design
KW  - knowledge representation
