TI  - Using Geographic Ontologies and Geo-Characterization to Represent Geographic Scenarios
T2  - ISPRS INTERNATIONAL JOURNAL OF GEO-INFORMATION
LA  - English
KW  - geographic environment
KW  - scenario
KW  - general system theory
KW  - evolution
KW  - interactive mechanisms
