TI  - A fast and effective deep learning approach for road extraction from historical maps by automatically generating training data with symbol reconstruction
T2  - INTERNATIONAL JOURNAL OF APPLIED EARTH OBSERVATION AND GEOINFORMATION
LA  - English
KW  - Cartography
KW  - Historical maps
KW  - Road extraction
KW  - GeoAI
