TI  - How does spatial structure affect psychological restoration? A method based on graph neural networks and street view imagery
T2  - LANDSCAPE AND URBAN PLANNING
LA  - English
KW  - Restoration
KW  - Graph neural network
KW  - Street view image
KW  - Spatial structure
