TI  - Bridging equity and resilience: A Systematic review of social sustainability in climate change mitigation and adaptation
T2  - ENVIRONMENTAL SCIENCE & POLICY
LA  - English
KW  - Climate justice
KW  - Social sustainability
KW  - Community resilience
KW  - Participatory AI
KW  - Climate equity
