TI  - Resolving stratified Pb and Cr hazards in 3D at an abandoned steel complex: A heterogeneity-learning approach to risk-based remediation
T2  - JOURNAL OF HAZARDOUS MATERIALS
LA  - English
KW  - Soil heavy metal contamination
KW  - Industrial site
KW  - Three-dimensional spatial interpolation
