TI  - Data-driven framework for eco-sensitive planning and design: a game theory-enhanced LUCIS approach to human-elephant conflict in Sri Lanka
T2  - FRONTIERS IN SUSTAINABILITY
LA  - English
KW  - urban informatics
KW  - eco-sensitive planning and design
KW  - human-elephant conflict
KW  - game theory
